    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   All right, I stopped the bleeding.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "All right, I stopped the bleeding."
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   You do this a lot, huh? For the Infected?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "You do this a lot, huh? For the Infected?"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   You're not afraid of me...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "You're not afraid of me..."
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   A lot of my coworkers are already Infected, but I can't tell who is and who isn't.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "A lot of my coworkers are already Infected, but I can't tell who is and who isn't."
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Huh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Well, it's sometimes hard to tell until it's time to hit the showers, right?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Well, it's sometimes hard to tell until it's time to hit the showers, right?"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"char_220_grani#2\",focus=1)]",
