        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   ...Hmph.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Big Bob",
        "content": "...Hmph."
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"Big Bob\"]   Thanks, shorty. You're naive, but you're a good person.",
